{"id":"9f037d0e39b6df5a","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-left-right-ce-computable.md","title":"Two-Sided Effective Approximation","display":"thm-left-right-ce-computable — Two-Sided Effective Approximation","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-left-right-ce-computable","aliases":["43-thm-left-right-ce-computable"],"display":"thm-left-right-ce-computable — Two-Sided Effective Approximation","depends_on":["[[43-df-leftcomputable]]","[[43-df-effective-real-cut]]","[[43-df-computable-real]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Theorem 8.1.2 and two-sided approximation consequence","source_printed_pages":"133","source_pdf_pages":"153","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-left-right-ce-computable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-left-right-ce-computable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-left-right-ce-computable — Two-Sided Effective Approximation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e7d00f16a112ff92\" href=\"?note=e7d00f16a112ff92\" title=\"43-df-leftcomputable\">43-df-leftcomputable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cee54b08acdf9958\" href=\"?note=cee54b08acdf9958\" title=\"43-df-effective-real-cut\">43-df-effective-real-cut</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"96d58aa7b6884a9b\" href=\"?note=96d58aa7b6884a9b\" title=\"43-df-computable-real\">43-df-computable-real</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 8.1.2 and two-sided approximation consequence"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"133"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"153"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span>；左右 c.e. 谓词见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e7d00f16a112ff92\" href=\"?note=e7d00f16a112ff92\" title=\"43-df-leftcomputable\">43-df-leftcomputable</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"cee54b08acdf9958\" href=\"?note=cee54b08acdf9958\" title=\"43-df-effective-real-cut\">43-df-effective-real-cut</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComputableReal}\">\\(\\mathrm{ComputableReal}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"96d58aa7b6884a9b\" href=\"?note=96d58aa7b6884a9b\" title=\"43-df-computable-real\">43-df-computable-real</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}\">\\(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e7d00f16a112ff92\" href=\"?note=e7d00f16a112ff92\" title=\"43-df-leftcomputable\">43-df-leftcomputable</a> 的同名符号。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RightComputable}\">\\(\\mathrm{RightComputable}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"cee54b08acdf9958\" href=\"?note=cee54b08acdf9958\" title=\"43-df-effective-real-cut\">43-df-effective-real-cut</a> 的同名符号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComputableReal}(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{RightComputable}(\\alpha).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ComputableReal}(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{RightComputable}(\\alpha).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>两侧逼近间距最终小于给定误差，搜索该阶段即可得到有效 Cauchy 近似；反方向对有效近似加减误差界并取累计最大/最小值。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorem 8.1.2 and two-sided approximation consequence；印刷页 133，PDF 页 153。本次逐项核对陈述；下文给出笔记内论证，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-leftcomputable","status":"resolved","id":"e7d00f16a112ff92","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-leftcomputable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-real-cut","status":"resolved","id":"cee54b08acdf9958","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-effective-real-cut]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable-real","status":"resolved","id":"96d58aa7b6884a9b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable-real]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-leftcomputable","status":"resolved","id":"e7d00f16a112ff92","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R$；左右 c.e. 谓词见 [[43-df-leftcomputable]]、[[43-df-effective-real-cut]]，$\\mathrm{ComputableReal}$ 见 [[43-df-computable-real]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-real-cut","status":"resolved","id":"cee54b08acdf9958","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R$；左右 c.e. 谓词见 [[43-df-leftcomputable]]、[[43-df-effective-real-cut]]，$\\mathrm{ComputableReal}$ 见 [[43-df-computable-real]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable-real","status":"resolved","id":"96d58aa7b6884a9b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R$；左右 c.e. 谓词见 [[43-df-leftcomputable]]、[[43-df-effective-real-cut]]，$\\mathrm{ComputableReal}$ 见 [[43-df-computable-real]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-leftcomputable","status":"resolved","id":"e7d00f16a112ff92","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LeftComputable}$ 采用 [[43-df-leftcomputable]] 的同名符号。 $\\mathrm{RightComputable}$ 采用 [[43-df-effective-real-cut]] 的同名符号。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-real-cut","status":"resolved","id":"cee54b08acdf9958","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LeftComputable}$ 采用 [[43-df-leftcomputable]] 的同名符号。 $\\mathrm{RightComputable}$ 采用 [[43-df-effective-real-cut]] 的同名符号。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComputableReal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RightComputable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComputableReal}(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{RightComputable}(\\alpha).","display":true}],"bytes":1653,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-152","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-left-right-ce-computable]] — Two-Sided Effective Approximation"}],"outgoing":["e7d00f16a112ff92","cee54b08acdf9958","96d58aa7b6884a9b"]}